{"id": "56519", "title": "情欲男女", "author": "左情右爱", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 11, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/56/56519.htm", "intro": "米婕是个又漂亮又泼辣的美女，经营着一家健身房。当她在心仪的郊区购得一处舒心的房子时，是兴奋的，开心的，可惜好心情很快被一个混蛋破坏。郭柏玮是一个芭拉的刑警，最大的爱好就是射击，健身，像抓捕罪犯一样扑倒美女，直到遇见自己的新邻居，才知道，饭可以乱吃，美女可不能乱扑。", "base": "files/article/html/56/56519", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "7917327.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "7917328.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "7917330.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "7917335.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "7917339.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "7917342.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "7917344.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "7917345.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "7917346.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "7917349.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "7917350.html", "available": false}]}